// Precursor sentry station: an anchored post of the core's defences (GDR-0110's stations; GDR-0130, lead default
// 20 Oct 2026). It never moves and turns on its cores: two long cannons and a torpedo launcher face forward, two long
// cannons back; a prism ward, two point defence turrets, a fusion reactor and radiators down both sides, plated in
// precursor alloy. PLACEHOLDER layout.
